     "type": "text",
     "html": "<h2>Trailer decals &amp; vinyl lettering</h2> <p>Want to make the most of your time on the road? Trailer decals and graphics can help you raise awareness about your business while you\u2019re on the go. Once the decal is in place, the weather-resistant, exquisite, and waterproof vinyl will look great. You can create trailer decals and graphics that promote information such as your company logo, address, phone number, and USP. Or simply make personalized graphics to make your trailer stand out.</p> <p>Vinyl Wrap Toronto is your one-stop shop for any and every type of <a href=\"/car-wrap-colours-avery-dennison-3m/#\">vehicle wrap</a>.</p> <p>For a free quote call us at <a href=\"tel:416-746-1381\">416-746-1381</a> or visit our office at <strong><a href=\"https://g.page/vinylwraptoronto?share\">24 Ronson Dr, Unit 1, Etobicoke, ON M9W 1B4</a>. </strong>You can also<strong> <a href=\"/contact/\">send us a message</a></strong> and our team will get back to you.</p>"
    }
   ]
